CSS classes
We use class to style our project/ work.
example: (In HTML)
- <body class="text">
- <div class="click">
like this we can make class in every element tag in html and style into different ( .css) file.
example: (In CSS)
.text {
    margin-top= 50px  ;
}
.click {
    background-image= #000000;
}
Always use (.) before using class name to style.
